{"parse": {"title": "狂人絮语", "pageid": 2233, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"狂人絮语\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/d2/Item-110504.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"狂人絮语\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>狂人絮语</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#110504</div></div><hr /><div>你所知范围以内，最最最最危险的书。用于角色的洞悉与共鸣仪式。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">那些漫长历史中隐秘、禁忌、遗落的咒文，都能在疯狂的呓语中窥见一二。祂是怀有野心的坏种们最好的导师。唯一的使用提示：只询问，永远不要回答。</div><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">来源</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-stage\"></td><td class=\"source-text\">荒原合成</td></tr><tr><td class=\"source-stage\"></td><td class=\"source-text\">迷途鉴定</td></tr><tr><td class=\"source-stage\">3RD-13</td><td class=\"source-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/3RD-13\" title=\"3RD-13\">一处庭院</a><span style=\"border: 1px solid; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 5px; display: inline-block; text-align: center; height: 20px; line-height: 18px; min-width: &#91;&#91;:模板:Width&#93;&#93;; color: #8c4646; padding: 0 5px;\">厄险</span><span style=\"border: 1px solid; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 5px; display: inline-block; text-align: center; height: 20px; line-height: 18px; min-width: &#91;&#91;:模板:Width&#93;&#93;; color: #666; padding: 0 5px;\">极小概率\n</span></td></tr></tbody></table><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">配方</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/110503\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%99%BE%E7%81%B5%E7%99%BE%E9%AA%8C%E9%B8%9F\" title=\"百灵百验鸟\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/150px-Bgequip4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/200px-Bgequip4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%99%BE%E7%81%B5%E7%99%BE%E9%AA%8C%E9%B8%9F\" title=\"百灵百验鸟\"><img alt=\"百灵百验鸟\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Item-110503.png/100px-Item-110503.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Item-110503.png/150px-Item-110503.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Item-110503.png/200px-Item-110503.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%99%BE%E7%81%B5%E7%99%BE%E9%AA%8C%E9%B8%9F\" title=\"百灵百验鸟\">百灵百验鸟</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">玻璃鸟儿，不会唱歌。不耐高温，轻拿轻放。用于角色的洞悉与共鸣仪式，亦可作为合成高阶材料的素材。</span></span><span>&#160;</span><span class=\"item-link-count\" style=\"float:right\">×3</span></span></td><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/110203\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%9B%90%E5%B0%81%E6%9B%BC%E5%BE%B7%E6%8B%89\" title=\"盐封曼德拉\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/150px-Bgequip4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/200px-Bgequip4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%9B%90%E5%B0%81%E6%9B%BC%E5%BE%B7%E6%8B%89\" title=\"盐封曼德拉\"><img alt=\"盐封曼德拉\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Item-110203.png/100px-Item-110203.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Item-110203.png/150px-Item-110203.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Item-110203.png/200px-Item-110203.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%9B%90%E5%B0%81%E6%9B%BC%E5%BE%B7%E6%8B%89\" title=\"盐封曼德拉\">盐封曼德拉</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">曼德拉草。用于角色的洞悉与共鸣仪式，亦可作为合成高阶材料的素材。</span></span><span>&#160;</span><span class=\"item-link-count\" style=\"float:right\">×2</span></span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"2/3\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%88%A9%E9%BD%BF%E5%AD%90%E5%84%BF\" title=\"利齿子儿\"><img alt=\"Bgequip3.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/100px-Bgequip3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/150px-Bgequip3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/200px-Bgequip3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-fi